ttps://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T20:49:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-16T12:53:38Z","body":"> Not reproducible in 4.7.1 stable. Tested on Windows 11. Also fixed with [#122095](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095) and [#122152](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152)—which [#122061](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122061) makes an unecessary attempt to superscede.\n\n**Neither #122095 nor #122152 fix this issue**, while https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122061 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122204 (now https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122350) do. You can test it yourself.\nAlso, there are several bugs in #122095 and #122152, which are fixed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122061 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122204.\n\nIf you fix these issues, you end up functionally with the code from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122061 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122204 (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122350 for 4.7.2).\nTherefore, my PR is not redundant; rather, it is the complete and correct solution.\n\n So, #122061 actually superscedes and should get merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286231206/reactions","total_cou