.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122257#issuecomment-5286477849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122257","id":5286477849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOxlAGQ","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T21:15:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T21:15:48Z","body":"@CarrotOfPower I did test it. I tested 4.7.1, and both my fixes, with compact mode off and on and at different values, with the sidebar exposed and hidden. Also, there are no bugs in #122095 nor #122152 and your claims of there being bugs are brash and getting overbearing. Just becuse you don't like the behaviour, means the behaviour is buggy. I opted to keep the behaviour of the resizing system I made the same regardless of the change in the project manager's new minimum size, you opted to change it, you don't need to pass the behaviour of my implementation off as a bug to justify your own, it's very antagonistic. \n\nIf the above is the only justification you have for your implementaion (although you didn't even know about compact mode until after I told you, after I gave you a hint by telling you to search for the real problem on your own, which you didn't do), it validates my opinion of it being unnecessary.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286477849/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286871911","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122257#issuecomment-5286871911","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122257","id":5286871911,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOx9DZw","user":{"login":"CarrotOfPower","id":260066004,"node_id":"U_kgDOD4BK1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260066004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower","html_url":"https://github.com/CarrotOfPower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarrotOfPower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T21:57:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T08:26:24Z","body":"> [@CarrotOfPower](https://github.com/CarrotOfPower) I did test it. I tested 4.7.1, and both my fixes, with compact mode off and on and at different values, with the sidebar exposed and hidden. Also, there are no bugs in [#122095](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095) nor [#122152](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152) and your claims of there being bugs are brash and getting overbearing. Just becuse you don't like the behaviour, means the behaviour is buggy. I opted to keep the behaviour of the resizing system I made the same regardless of the change in the project manager's new minimum size, you opted to change it, you don't need to pass the behaviour of my implementation off as a bug to justify your own, it's very antagonistic.\n> \n> If the above is the only justification you have for your implementaion (although you didn't even know about compact mode until after I told you, after I gave you a hint by telling you to search for the real problem on your own, which you didn't do), it validates my opinion of it being unnecessary.\n\nNeither https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095 nor https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152 fix this issue, while https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122061 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122204 (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122350 for 4.7.2) do:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e5a8cfa-aa69-4a01-a04a-b8f1274e2faf\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b8f907f-f409-46b4-b7ae-4781d0104d0f\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d26b7f47-30c5-4e88-a419-47b1db708323\n\nI intentionally excluded your design decision from the bugs. I don't want such a heated discussion. The changes are open source, so you can compare them.\nIf https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122095 / https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152 should get merged, it's less effort for me to open a new PR that fixes the bugs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5286871911/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"hea